        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ebiragiro ebirukukwata ha bugwetwa bwa baisiki abanyakuswirwe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakuru b'amaju ag'ebitabu eby'abaana ba Giryadi mutabani wa Makiri, mwijukuru wa Manaase, ab'amaju aga batabani ba Yosefu, bakairra haihi Musa n'abeebembezi bakuru b'amaju g'abantu ba Isirairi baabagambira bati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.27.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kubar 27:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“MUKAMA akakuragira, obugwetwa obwa Zerofehadi mugenzi waitu kugiha bahara be. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu abaisiki abo, obu baraaba bali bakazi baswerwa, baswirwe aboojo ab'enganda ezindi ez'abantu ba Isirairi, obu, obugwetwa bwabo bwihwe omu bugwetwa obwa ba isiitwe bwongerwe omu ruganda oru baswirwemu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekiro ky'okujaguza kw'Abaana ba Isirairi habw'emyaka makumi ataano obu kirihika, nubwo obugwetwa bw'abaisiki abo buliihwa ha bugwetwa bwa baisenkuruitwe, buteeranizibwe ha bugwetwa bw'oruganda baaswirwemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa yaragira abantu ba Isirairi MUKAMA nkooku yagambire ati: “Oruganda orwa batabani ba Yosefu, ekirurukugamba kihikire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kinu nikyo MUKAMA yaragiire ha bahara ba Zerofehadi, nibaikirizibwa kuswerwa buli musaija weena ou barukurora bati ngu ogu nuwe arukukira oburungi; kyonka baswerege omuntu ow'ekitabu eky'oruganda rwa isebo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obugwetwa obw'abantu ba Isirairi, butaliihwaho oruganda orumu bukaheebwa oruganda orundi; habwokuba buli muntu omu Isirairi, aliikara n'obugwetwa obwa baisenkuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi omwana weena omwisiki araatungaga obugwetwa omu ruganda rwona orw'abantu ba Isirairi, aswerwege omuntu ow'ekitabu eky'oruganda rwa ise, nukwo abantu ba Isirairi boona basobole kutunga obugwetwa obwa baise bo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habweki, hatalibaho ensi erukwihwaho oruganda orumu ekaheebwa oruganda orundi; habwokuba buli ruganda orw'Abaisirairi rw'okwikaraga n'ensi yarwo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahara ba Zerofehadi, baakora kyona MUKAMA eki yaragiire Musa habwokuba: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mahara, Tiiriza, Hogora, Mirika na Noha bakaswerwa aboojo aba baisento bo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakaswerwa omu bitabu ebya batabani ba Manaase, mutabani wa Yosefu, ensi yabo yasigara omu ruganda orw'ekitabu ekya baise bo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Binu nibyo biragiro kandi nibyo ebigambo MUKAMA ebi yaragiire abantu ba Isirairi, naabikwasa Musa omu byeya bya Mowabbu oroleriire Yeriko haihi n'ekisaaru Yorudaani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
